{
  "family": "replay",
  "description": "The batch id is the import identity (Kafka Connect: the buffer is keyed, not the payload): same facts under a fresh batch are a replace today (Issue# 322 - tap open), a rolled-back batch leaves no identity behind so a corrected retry commits, a replayed batch beside a new one is inert, and ref labels never leak across documents.",
  "scenarios": [
