            "update": 1
          }
        },
        "note": "Pinned as today's contract: re-observation is recorded as a change. Issue# 322 - tap asks for a re-observation state that does not version; when it is ruled, this scenario's expectation changes, not its shape."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a failed document retried under the same batch id commits: a rolled-back batch left no identity behind",
      "tags": [],
      "covers": [
        "req-grid-import-grift-identity-1",
        "req-grid-import-grift-batch",
        "req-grift-concurrency-version-7"
