    {
      "name": "a replayed batch beside a new batch on the same id: the file is refused, because an id may appear once per file",
      "tags": [],
      "covers": [
        "req-grid-import-grift-identity-1",
        "req-grid-import-grift-batch",
        "req-grid-import-grift-preflight-2"
      ],
      "grid": {
        "nodes": [],
        "edges": []
      },
      "imports": [
        {
          "batches": [
            {
              "name": "b1",
              "nodes": [
                {
                  "id": "A",
                  "type": "grid_fixtures__node",
                  "props": {
                    "name": "A, v1"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "batches": [
            {
              "name": "b1",
              "nodes": [
                {
                  "id": "A",
                  "type": "grid_fixtures__node",
                  "props": {
                    "name": "A, edited replay"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "b2",
              "nodes": [
                {
                  "id": "A",
                  "type": "grid_fixtures__node",
                  "props": {
                    "name": "A, v2"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "imports": [
          {
            "success": true,
            "batches": {
              "b1": "committed"
            },
            "errors": []
          },
          {
            "success": false,
            "batches": {
              "b1": "skipped",
              "b2": "refused"
            },
            "errors": [
              {
                "code": "duplicate_entity_id",
                "path": "$.batches[1].nodes[0].entity.entity_id"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "live": {
          "A": 1
        },
        "tombstoned": {},
        "absent": [],
        "fields": {
          "A": {
            "name": "A, v1"
          }
        },
        "note": "The author first expected the replay to be inert and b2 to write; the model disagreed at load: file-wide id uniqueness is checked at preflight before any batch is skipped, so the seen batch's edited content plus the fresh batch's write on one id is a refused file. A kept at version 1 with b1's payload. A discriminating case found by the oracle, not by reading the importer."
      }
    },
